    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gimarac",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu owaco ri jofonjirok pere ni, “Gigipiny ma miyo ji podho i gimarac ripo bino; to kidamba bino bedo ri ŋat'omiy gigipiny no timirok! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'ober rigo bedi tweyi kidi m'ombo i ŋute t'ibolo go i wakawaka, loyo go kidho miyo acel kwoŋ nyaka jomathindho me timo gimarac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.18.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 18:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kure win! Ka omerin timo gimarac, kwer rigo, aka ka oŋuti, cwaki go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'otimo rin marac dibirio ndelo acel, aka hongo je go bino bongin ka waco ni aŋuto, iripo cwako go.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeyo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jomoor jowaco ri Rwoth ni, “Medi riwan yeyo mawan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth odwoko ni, “Bedi winitie gi yeyo kada mathin paka nyingi kalantus di wiwaco ri yath madwoŋ me ni, ‘Fudhere woko gi tiendin ikidhi ipidhere i dier wakawaka, d'owinjo win.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gima jatic ripo timo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bedi moro kwoŋ win nitie gi jatic ma furo, kosa ma kwayo rombo, iparo ni ka jatic no odwoko wok i ndelo, d'owaco rigo ni, ‘Redi mayot ibedi piny ikutho icem?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'ameno be! Kucel d'owaco rigo ni, ‘Kutho iyiki ran cemo m'othieno, itwey nanga i korin, ikuran k'acemo aka amadho gir'amadha, ŋey nyaka inocem rumacen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Odoko, i paro ni di go ofoyo jatic no k'otimo gim'oro go?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno win bende ka witieko timo gimoro je m'owaci riwin, wiripo waco ni, ‘Wabedo riwan nyaka jotic atica, aka wacowo timo nyaka tic m'onwaŋo ripo watim kende.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu botho cwo ma jodhowo apar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Yesu oyido kidho Yerusalem, oluwo gi i kew ma poko Samaria kodi Galili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka munyo go oyido nyaka donjo loka moro, jodhowo moro japar joromo gine. Jocungo gi bor bor ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to jokoko rigo ni, “Yesu, Jadwoŋ! Maki wor gi wan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.14.1+LEV.14.2+LEV.14.3+LEV.14.4+LEV.14.5+LEV.14.6+LEV.14.7+LEV.14.8+LEV.14.9+LEV.14.10+LEV.14.11+LEV.14.12+LEV.14.13+LEV.14.14+LEV.14.15+LEV.14.16+LEV.14.17+LEV.14.18+LEV.14.19+LEV.14.20+LEV.14.21+LEV.14.22+LEV.14.23+LEV.14.24+LEV.14.25+LEV.14.26+LEV.14.27+LEV.14.28+LEV.14.29+LEV.14.30+LEV.14.31+LEV.14.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 14:1-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Yesu oneno jo, owaco rijo ni, “Kidhi winyuthere i waŋ jocway ri Were i wi migam.” Gikenyo munyo fodi jowotho jokadho to delkwoŋ gin lokere m'olony. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋat'acel kwoŋ jo, munyo oneno ni kwoŋe ocango, ogik cen munyo pako Were gi derino madwoŋ swa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to podho piny dho ka tiendi Yesu to foyo go. Jalo oyido obedo Jasamaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gino omiyo Yesu openjo ni, “Alwoŋo ni ji apar je jolony; to jabuŋwen man jonikune? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongoye ŋat'onyalo gik bino foyo Were kwanyo woko japath me kende?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka owaco ri jalo ni, “Ay malo imaki royo perin; yeyo perin otieko bothin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bino pa Ker",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jofarisayo megi jopenjo Yesu ndir ma Ker pa Were obin'iye. Go odwoko ni, “Ker pa Were kilabino i royo ma nenere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongoye ŋata bino waco ni, ‘Neni, ee ni ka, kosa ni kaca.’ Kole Ker pa Were nitie i dier win won ka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka owaco ri jofonjirok pere ni, “Hongo bino tundo ma wibino yenyo neno kada nyaka ndelo acel kwoŋ ndir pa Wod Dhano, to wikibino neno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitie joma jobino waco riwin ni, ‘Neni, go dica!’ Kosa ni ‘Neni, go ee ka!’ To wikiri wiay ni wikidho rango go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole paka lithkoth pilin i pondeponde aka menyo thenge gi thenge, apaka Wod Dhano bende obedi i ndelo pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To go ripo kutho candirok tektek, ji ma ndir me jowokwer go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.6.5+GEN.6.6+GEN.6.7+GEN.6.8"
              },
              "items": [
