              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo jofonjirok jopenjo go ni, “Yokune, Rwoth?” Yesu odwoko ni, “Kama gim'otho nitie iye, am'acut jocoker'iye.”",
          "type": "text",
